===Etymology===
{{surf|zle-ort|больный|t1=|-ица}}. Cognate with {{cog|ru|больни́ца}}, which is from {{cog|zle-mru|больница|sc=Cyrs}}, attested in 16-17ᵗʰ c., Church Slavonic {{m|cu|больни́ца}}.

